<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθουσα</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοά</span>), ἡ, properly
		part. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθω</span> (q.v.), in
		the Homeric house, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>portico,
				verandah, to catch the sun</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμον . . ξεστῇς αἰθούσῃσι τετυγμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.243
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				237
			</span></i>: in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> esp. of a <i>loggia</i> leading from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span> to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόδομος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				3.399
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. ἐρίδουπος,</span>
			echoing to the tramp of horses, <i><span class="en">
				15.146
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνειον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.78
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθουσσα</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.919
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, which may point to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθοῦσσα</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθόεσσα.</span>
			)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
